# App-authored transition, not from a tape. Public material describes F34/35
# as one paired Gathering region. The owner's attributed account tentatively
# places the ceremony further out at F35, but cannot establish a clean border.
# This body makes the count an observation point rather than asserting a shift.

@segment    climb-f34-f35
@title      Climb — Focus 34 to Focus 35
@levels     F35
@from       F34
@fixed
@verbosity  3
@protected  Focus 35
@duration   ~1m

say You will move now from Focus 34 to Focus 35.
pause 4
say Public material describes 34 and 35 together as one Gathering region. One attributed account places a ceremony further out, but does not establish a clear border between the two levels.
pause 7
say Let the next number become an observation point. Notice whether the vantage changes, and do not force a distinction if none is present.
pause 6
level F35
say Thirty-four.
pause 5
say Thirty-five.
pause 4
say Focus 35.
pause 8
